# ============================================================================
# ToneGuard — Strict Whitelist .gitignore
# Ensures ONLY README.md + Application Code Files are uploaded to GitHub.
# All local videos, pitch decks, summaries, and helper scripts are ignored.
# ============================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Explicitly allow ONLY README.md & Core Application Code Files
!.gitignore
!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!README.md
!package.json
!server.js
!index.html
!pitch-deck.html
!manifest.json
!sw.js

# Allow CSS and JS source directories & their code files
!css/
!css/style.css
!js/
!js/app.js
!js/worker.js
!js/pitch-deck.js

# 3. Never upload secrets, environment files, or OS temp files
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

